{"hash": "1f68f69ad31f8ce2adbebbf3da17d5eb9bdf072145280f8fbfd890e475f45545", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f3f861c01c0c3ce0ff7eb51d9031a1099a994919c274106d7637fe6839119d5e", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "1f68f69ad31f8ce2adbebbf3da17d5eb9bdf072145280f8fbfd890e475f45545", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "41fb775edc1d866c28ef505a9fd47ab7344cffa59b9c9782c01e1013235c9ca9", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f3f861c01c0c3ce0ff7eb51d9031a1099a994919c274106d7637fe6839119d5e", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "61b3afa4f6a024a5b2545937879c53bec46b5bed4470928995fb2f0f47f7076f", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "41fb775edc1d866c28ef505a9fd47ab7344cffa59b9c9782c01e1013235c9ca9", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "409592698493e490f9f1b51a0d4444ec1b55af5dbe1045fb47699992e267ea23", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "61b3afa4f6a024a5b2545937879c53bec46b5bed4470928995fb2f0f47f7076f", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0c4bab5a764b02d86cdbb0ef0fe3f22c8727422c40f96b6b049ac585ba01791b", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "409592698493e490f9f1b51a0d4444ec1b55af5dbe1045fb47699992e267ea23", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "85d9efed721817f881e71f8840e05e920c916222517b7ba4e80fc4fad81e1e57", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0c4bab5a764b02d86cdbb0ef0fe3f22c8727422c40f96b6b049ac585ba01791b", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "79b8686dbc5845d6f0bef1fc46e524ca4e7ada7bbcb95483d0083a570161eacb", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "85d9efed721817f881e71f8840e05e920c916222517b7ba4e80fc4fad81e1e57", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0e94ab08479f3e45ebcfbec23d07fa26e19d07704178c3ae6885b6689bfc8048", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "79b8686dbc5845d6f0bef1fc46e524ca4e7ada7bbcb95483d0083a570161eacb", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d515225ff6ea4a00fd7bc58dd65202dcf6ecf5b69e9a0d810e27a9414656a2ee", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0e94ab08479f3e45ebcfbec23d07fa26e19d07704178c3ae6885b6689bfc8048", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cdbe1c7e733e0eeae5d183d9139ba6851c17d5c512db4dcae6c4202d5dcb63f1", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d515225ff6ea4a00fd7bc58dd65202dcf6ecf5b69e9a0d810e27a9414656a2ee", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "1e48ad8239b74a2b6300ce54d85b0c3148e7f6561c20c2fe5b79cdc253e9e98e", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cdbe1c7e733e0eeae5d183d9139ba6851c17d5c512db4dcae6c4202d5dcb63f1", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "415bce165860e32704c3df41b92f5a78a4ccce68520c68ddf913b176a76eaaed"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
